! Silicon on a shifted 4x4x4 grid with symmetry kept, for real-time propagation
! on the wedge of the field's little group.
!
! `si2-symmetric.in` with the grid shifted by half a step on every axis. A
! shifted grid is not closed under the point group: of the eight operations that
! fix a field along [100], two map this grid onto itself, and the 64 points
! reduce to 40 under those two. The wedge of those two, with the current averaged
! over them, is checked against the whole shifted grid propagated point by point.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 2, celldm(1) = 10.2, nat = 2, ntyp = 1,
    ecutwfc = 12.0
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-10
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Si 28.086 Si.pz-vbc.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
 Si 0.00 0.00 0.00
 Si 0.25 0.25 0.25
K_POINTS (automatic)
 4 4 4 1 1 1
